# BathroomMaps

BathroomMaps is an Android app that helps users locate public restrooms, rate cleanliness, and provide operational hours. It is built using **Kotlin** in **Android Studio** with **Firebase Authentication**, **Firestore**, and **Firebase Storage** integration.


