## About the Project
Finding public bathrooms can be challenging in many cities. BathroomMaps allows users to:
- Search for public restrooms
- View cleanliness ratings and operating hours
- Add, edit, and delete bathroom entries
- Upload photos for reference

The app ensures live updates from Firestore, so changes appear instantly for all users.

## Features
- **Firebase Authentication** (login, register, password change)
- **Firestore Integration** with live updates (`addSnapshotListener`)
- **AddBathroomActivity** to create new entries with:
  - Title & description
  - Optional hours
  - Cleanliness rating
  - Optional photo upload
- **Edit & Delete Bathrooms**
- XML-based UI for login/register, with Jetpack Compose for bathroom listings



## Technologies Used
- **Language:** Kotlin
- **IDE:** Android Studio
- **UI:** XML Layouts + Jetpack Compose
- **Backend:** Firebase Authentication, Firestore, Firebase Storage
- **Version Control:** Git & GitHub

